IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dog-act-domain`

-- =============================================================================
-- Dog Act 1976 (Western Australia) -- Part II, Administration
--
-- Isomorphic encoding of Part II ("Administration"), ss. 9, 9A, 9B, 10, 10AA,
-- 10AB, 10A, 11, 11A, 12, 12A, 13, 13A and 13B, as at the compilation dated
-- 28 Nov 2024 [version 08-b0-00], re-verified current 2026-09-09. This Part
-- is machinery -- local-government/CEO administration, delegation, entry and
-- search powers, and immunity from proceedings. There are no penalty-bearing
-- offences in this Part; the "dangerous dog" penalty regime lives in Part VI
-- Division 2, encoded separately in dog-act-1976.l4 (which this file does
-- NOT import, in line with this workflow's cross-module scoping rule --
-- every parallel chunk's encoding is being written independently right now).
