-- s. 54 (regulation-making power, referenced at ss. 13A(5), 13B), the
-- Part VI Division 2 offences a s. 12A(4) entry investigates (already encoded
-- in dog-act-1976.l4, but that module is NOT imported here), and other Acts
-- referenced only in passing: Public Health Act 2016 s. 31 (s. 11(4)),
-- Local Government Act 1995 ss. 1.4, 3.68, 9.10(2) (ss. 10AA(1), 11(1)-(2),
-- (5), 11A), Cat Act 2011 s. 41A(1) (s. 13A(6)).
