`s 13A(2) facts -- recorded, accurate and current` MEANS `S13A2 Compliance Facts` WITH `prescribed information recorded in the centralised registration system` IS TRUE, `information recorded is accurate and kept up to date` IS TRUE
`s 13A(2) facts -- recorded but stale` MEANS `S13A2 Compliance Facts` WITH `prescribed information recorded in the centralised registration system` IS TRUE, `information recorded is accurate and kept up to date` IS FALSE

