-- s 13B
`a past dog owner, no prescribed class` MEANS `S13B Person` WITH `owns, or has previously owned, 1 or more dogs` IS TRUE, `is of a class prescribed for the purposes of s 13B(1)(b)` IS FALSE
`a person with no dog history, not of a prescribed class` MEANS `S13B Person` WITH `owns, or has previously owned, 1 or more dogs` IS FALSE, `is of a class prescribed for the purposes of s 13B(1)(b)` IS FALSE
`a person of a prescribed class, no dog history` MEANS `S13B Person` WITH `owns, or has previously owned, 1 or more dogs` IS FALSE, `is of a class prescribed for the purposes of s 13B(1)(b)` IS TRUE

